{"synopsis":"Ye Chuan—seorang pasien gangguan jiwa—melihat semua makhluk hidup di dunia sebagai babi. Pada hari ia berganti profesi, ia menemukan pekerjaan yang sangat bergengsi: Butcher. Guru-guru dan teman sekelasnya sangat kecewa, dan bahkan kekasih masa kecilnya meninggalkannya. Namun, profesi Butcher memberinya kerusakan ekstra terhadap babi dan mengurangi separuh kerusakan yang ia terima dari mereka. Karena ia melihat semua orang sebagai babi, ia menggunakan satu pisau jagal untuk bangkit dan menjadi dewa!","alternative_title":"A Pig-Slaughtering Knife Cutting Through All Realms - Makes Sense, Right?, The Butcher Blade That Pierces All Realms, 一把杀猪刀，砍翻万界很合理吧？","author":"Hui Pu_Lp4hbt","artist":"Hui Pu_Lp4hbt","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"87dffb9d-071d-4b32-9b49-1f43c7ce2674","number":"49","chapter":"49","title":"","date":"2026-08-03","released":"2026-08-03","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_ca940720-93ac-4c05-97c4-93efce095fc9/chapter_ch_49/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/man